        <section id="methods-of-active-listening"  class="t-bg-primary">
          
            <h2>Methods of active listening</h2>
              <p>So how can someone become an active listener?</p>

              
              <!-- IF 2 --><ul class="l-icon-grid ">
  
  
    
    <!--  -->
      
  
  
    
  
  <li class="c-reveal-block">
    <img class="c-reveal-block__icon js-showhide" src="~/images/svg/uc/uc_u5_s1_p3_reveal1.svg" alt="Undivided attention" width="266" height="266">
    
    <div class="c-reveal-block__desc">
      <h3 aria-hidden="true">Undivided attention</h3>
      <p>To become a more active listener a person must give the speaker their undivided attention and acknowledge the fact that they are listening by non-verbal communication.</p>

    </div>
  </li>
      
  
  
    
  
  <li class="c-reveal-block">
    <img class="c-reveal-block__icon js-showhide" src="~/images/svg/uc/uc_u5_s1_p3_reveal2.svg" alt="Look directly at the speaker" width="266" height="266">
    
    <div class="c-reveal-block__desc">
      <h3 aria-hidden="true">Look directly at the speaker</h3>
      <p>It helps to look directly at the speaker and put aside any distracting thoughts.</p>

    </div>
  </li>
      
  
  
    
  
  <li class="c-reveal-block">
    <img class="c-reveal-block__icon js-showhide" src="~/images/svg/uc/uc_u5_s1_p3_reveal3.svg" alt="Body language" width="266" height="266">
    
    <div class="c-reveal-block__desc">
      <h3 aria-hidden="true">Body language</h3>
      <p>Using body language and responding using expressions can show can help to show engagement.</p>

    </div>
  </li>
      
  
  
    
  
  <li class="c-reveal-block">
    <img class="c-reveal-block__icon js-showhide" src="~/images/svg/uc/uc_u5_s1_p3_reveal4.svg" alt="Questions and paraphrasing" width="266" height="266">
    
    <div class="c-reveal-block__desc">
      <h3 aria-hidden="true">Questions and paraphrasing</h3>
      <p>Asking questions and paraphrasing can also help to show that the listener understands.</p>

    </div>
  </li>
      
  
  
    
  
  <li class="c-reveal-block">
    <img class="c-reveal-block__icon js-showhide" src="~/images/svg/uc/uc_u5_s1_p3_reveal5.svg" alt="Allow speaker to finish" width="266" height="266">
    
    <div class="c-reveal-block__desc">
      <h3 aria-hidden="true">Allow speaker to finish</h3>
      <p>Allowing the speaker to finish before making judgements also makes sure that the message and information is fully absorbed.</p>

    </div>
  </li>
      
  
  
    
  
  <li class="c-reveal-block">
    <img class="c-reveal-block__icon js-showhide" src="~/images/svg/uc/uc_u5_s1_p3_reveal6.svg" alt="Responding respectfully" width="266" height="266">
    
    <div class="c-reveal-block__desc">
      <h3 aria-hidden="true">Responding respectfully</h3>
      <p>Being respectful in any responses is also an important part of being an active listener.</p>

    </div>
  </li>
  
</ul>

            
          
